Upstream MP4 hardening adapted to the 1.13.1 Atom layout and offset API.
A single count across all roots and descendants also enforces the per-level
limit. Preserve the exported one-argument constructor and all object layouts.
The QuickTime chapter implementation in newer releases is absent in 1.13.1.
Upstream commits: https://github.com/taglib/taglib/commit/<full ID below>.

